{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2023-06-21 15:45:00', 'title': 'OMNICOM MEDIA GROUP AND ALBERTSONS MEDIA COLLECTIVE PARTNER TO DELIVER HOLISTIC VIDEO PLANNING AND ATTRIBUTION ACROSS LINEAR AND STREAMING CHANNELS', 'text': 'NBCUNIVERSAL, PARAMOUNT AND WARNER BROS-DISCOVERY AUDIENCE DATA WILL BE ACCESSED VIA FIRST-OF-A-KIND MULTI-PARTY CLEAN ROOM CONNECTIONS ENABLED BY SNOWFLAKE AND VIDEOAMP CANNES, FRANCE , JUNE 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0OMNICOM MEDIA GROUP (OMG), THE MEDIA SERVICES DIVISION OF OMNICOM GROUP INC\xa0.(NYSE:\xa0OMC) AND ALBERTSONS MEDIA COLLECTIVE, THE RETAIL MEDIA ARM FOR THE ALBERTSONS COMPANIES (NYSE:\xa0ACI) ARE TAKING THEIR FIRST-MOVER PARTNERSHIP TO THE NEXT LEVEL, COLLABORATING WITHIN THE OMNI OPEN OPERATING SYSTEM TO PROVIDE OMNICOM CLIENTS WITH A FIRST-TO-MARKET HOLISTIC VIEW OF THEIR CROSS-CHANNEL VIDEO INVESTMENT.'}